{"content":[{"c":["EAST WIND"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Wind coming mostly in May, September, and October. This scorching wind, also called a sirocco, destroyed vegetation (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.41.6","r":"Gen.41.6","rawR":"Gen.41.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.41.6","value":"Gen.41.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 41:6"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ezek.17.10","r":"Ezek.17.10","rawR":"Ezek.17.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezek.17.10","value":"Ezek.17.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ez 17:10"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jon.4.8","r":"Jon.4.8","rawR":"Jon.4.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jon.4.8","value":"Jon.4.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jon 4:8"},"), withered flowers (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.103.15-16","r":"Ps.103.15-16","rawR":"Ps.103.15-16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.103.15-16","value":"Ps.103.15-16"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 103:15-16"},"), and dried up fountains and springs (",{"href":"?bref=Hos.13.15","r":"Hos.13.15","rawR":"Hos.13.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Hos.13.15","value":"Hos.13.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Hos 13:15"},"). The Lord used an east wind to drive back the waters of the Red Sea for the Israelites to cross (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.14.21","r":"Exod.14.21","rawR":"Exod.14.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.14.21","value":"Exod.14.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 14:21"},"). The east wind also depicts God’s judgment (",{"href":"?bref=Isa.27.8","r":"Isa.27.8","rawR":"Isa.27.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.27.8","value":"Isa.27.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 27:8"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.4.11","r":"Jer.4.11","rawR":"Jer.4.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.4.11","value":"Jer.4.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 4:11"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.18.17","r":"Jer.18.17","rawR":"Jer.18.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.18.17","value":"Jer.18.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"18:17"},"). An east or northeast wind drove the apostle Paul’s ship off course (",{"href":"?bref=Acts.27.14","r":"Acts.27.14","rawR":"Acts.27.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.27.14","value":"Acts.27.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 27:14"},", ",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," “Euroclydon”). That wind, which is frequent in the western Mediterranean, is called a “levanter.”"],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"EastWind","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 41:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.41.6","rawQueryValue":"Gen.41.6","sourceRefExact":"Gen.41.6"},{"anchorText":"Ez 17:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezek.17.10","rawQueryValue":"Ezek.17.10","sourceRefExact":"Ezek.17.10"},{"anchorText":"Jon 4:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jon.4.8","rawQueryValue":"Jon.4.8","sourceRefExact":"Jon.4.8"},{"anchorText":"Ps 103:15-16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ps.103.15-16","rawQueryValue":"Ps.103.15-16","sourceRefExact":"Ps.103.15-16"},{"anchorText":"Hos 13:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Hos.13.15","rawQueryValue":"Hos.13.15","sourceRefExact":"Hos.13.15"},{"anchorText":"Ex 14:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.14.21","rawQueryValue":"Exod.14.21","sourceRefExact":"Exod.14.21"},{"anchorText":"Is 27:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.27.8","rawQueryValue":"Isa.27.8","sourceRefExact":"Isa.27.8"},{"anchorText":"Jer 4:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.4.11","rawQueryValue":"Jer.4.11","sourceRefExact":"Jer.4.11"},{"anchorText":"18:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.18.17","rawQueryValue":"Jer.18.17","sourceRefExact":"Jer.18.17"},{"anchorText":"Acts 27:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.27.14","rawQueryValue":"Acts.27.14","sourceRefExact":"Acts.27.14"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"b8d5e4ac3e83de6e32917bd8282d8dbda6dfc94bbab400606fc84a98b6a69557","sourceItemName":"EastWind","sourceItemOrder":11,"sourceMember":"Articles/E.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"EastWind","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"East Wind","title":"East Wind","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}